# TypeScript — `contracts/` & `client/react-client/`

## Scope
TypeScript lives in `contracts/` (shared types, schemas, and content contracts in the pnpm workspace) and `client/react-client/` (web client). The game server is Rust (`server-rs/`).

## Standards
- **Strict**: `strict: true`, no unjustified `any`, explicit public interfaces.
- **Formatting & lint**: Prettier + ESLint clean on all touched files.
- **Naming**: PascalCase for types/components, camelCase for functions/hooks, `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` for constants.
- **Patterns**: Single options object for constructors (see `01-apis-and-constructors.mdc`).

## Build & Test
```bash
# Shared contracts (pnpm workspace)
cd contracts && pnpm run build && pnpm test && npx tsc --noEmit

# React web client (own package-lock.json)
cd client/react-client && CI=true npx react-scripts test --watchAll=false
```
